{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/dream_summer.png?t=1748624834\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Summer of 1999. After years of begging, your parents have finally sent you off to your dream sleep-away camp on a picturesque lake. But a reckless game of Truth or Dare leads to you sneaking into the neighboring camp across the lake.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A camp that is full of clowns. And they don\u2019t take too kindly to trespassers. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/woods1.gif?t=1748624834\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/happy_camper.png?t=1748624834\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run. Hide. Fight (<i>if you must</i>).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survive until you can return to the safe side of the lake. Along the way, uncover the disturbing truth behind Clown Camp. Find environmental clues and postcards among the creaking cabins and pine trees. Carefully manage a small inventory that is essential to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/inventory.png?t=1748624834\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/retro_flare.png?t=1748624834\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bask in the dithered glow of a design philosophy inspired by the days when surviving horror required both courage AND skill. Low poly 3D models, grainy filters, tight narrative, challenging gameplay, and puzzles take center stage once again. Additional modern quality of life features provide wider accessibility options on top of an intentionally retro base experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/pickup.gif?t=1748624834\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765700?t=1748624834","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765700?t=1748624834","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/29dadea0acc07ed064d1419766bc09643aca10c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748624834","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/29dadea0acc07ed064d1419766bc09643aca10c6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748624834","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of horror and general violence."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765700/extras/dream_summer.png?t=1748624834\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Summer of 1999. After years of begging, your parents hav